      "kind": "diagram",
      "alt": "Diagram of a horizontal shelf PQ fixed to a vertical wall at P, held horizontal by a bar XY at an angle, with a box labelled book on the shelf. Arrows labelled F, W_s and W_b, and the angle theta are marked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The weight of the shelf is $W_\\text{s}$ and the weight of the book is $W_\\text{b}$."
    },
